---
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';

const contactEmail = 'hello@m8tcha.com';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Contact Information"
  description="How to contact M8tcha for support, privacy, safety, and legal matters."
>
  <p>
    M8tcha, Inc. is a Delaware corporation operating the M8tcha app and related services in the
    United States. Email is the fastest way to reach the team.
  </p>

  <h2>General Support</h2>
  <p>
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a><br />
    Include the email address on your M8tcha account, a short description, and relevant dates. Never
    send a password, full payment-card number, or security code.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy Requests</h2>
  <p>
    Send access, deletion, correction, data, or other privacy requests to{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>{' '}with the subject “Privacy Request.” See our{' '}
    <a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>{' '}for request rights, verification, and response times.
  </p>

  <h2>Safety and Abuse Reports</h2>
  <p>
    Report users and content through the in-app tools whenever possible. For urgent danger, contact
    local emergency services. For other safety concerns, email
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a> with the subject “Safety Report.”
  </p>

  <h2>Billing</h2>
  <p>
    For Stripe billing questions, email <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a> with the
    charge date, amount, and account email. Apple and Google store purchases must be managed through
    the applicable store. Review our <a href="/legal/pricing">Pricing</a>{' '}and{' '}
    <a href="/legal/refunds">Refund Policy</a> pages for more information.
  </p>

  <h2>Legal and Law Enforcement</h2>
  <p>
    Legal notices and authorized government requests may be sent to{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>. See our{' '}
    <a href="/legal/law-enforcement">law-enforcement protocols</a>{' '}before submitting a request.
  </p>

  <h2>App Store Complaints and Claims</h2>
  <p>
    Questions, complaints, or claims about the M8tcha iOS app (the Licensed Application) should be
    directed to M8tcha, Inc., Delaware, United States, at{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>. M8tcha, not Apple, is responsible for
    the app and for providing maintenance and support.
  </p>

  <p><strong>Business:</strong> M8tcha, Inc., Delaware, United States</p>
</LegalPage>
